"This removes Stickler, its models and the saved analyses. Your songs and "
"exports stay."
msgstr ""
"Esto quita Stickler, sus modelos y los análisis guardados. Tus canciones y "
"exportaciones se quedan."

#. Translators: Windows uninstaller, the second question after "Uninstall Stickler?"; "No"
#. (the default) keeps them, so a new install picks up where the user left off
#: src/stickler_app/win_texts.py:59
